unks» que tocan country ambientado entre inadaptados: Long Ryders, Jason & The Scorchers, Fetchin Bones, Lone Justice, Beat Farmers. El populismo de Los Lobos, Del Fuegos, Del-Lords y Walkabouts; en la Costa Oeste, los dementes Camper Van Beethoven, Donner Party, Catheads, Thin White Rope y los American Music Club de Mark Eitzel; en Texas, Wild Seeds, Poi Dog Pondering, Glass Eye; en los Grandes Lagos, BoDeans, Soul Asylum, Afghan Whigs, Shrimp Boat y los canadienses Cowboy Junkies. Nashville se renueva con los neotradicionalistas (George Strait, Randy Travis, Garth Brooks, Lyle Lovett, Steve Earle, Dwight Yoakam) y el surf instrumental vuelve con Shadowy Men On A Shadowy Planet.","color":"#f59e0b","family":"Raíces: rock'n'roll, country y roots","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":19438066321678,"artist":"Thin White Rope","artist_id":110777524166638,"title":"Exploring The Axis","year":1985,"ess":0,"yt":"LM8RRJNHbmI","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Roots-rock de los ochenta y cow-punk","scene_id":227407993671548,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s","chapters":["Sección 5.17"],"pages":[[1,193,null]]},{"id":179330588667640,"artist":"Thin White Rope","artist_id":110777524166638,"title":"Sack Full Of Silver","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"kttUwMLLS8k","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Roots-rock de los ochenta y cow-punk","scene_id":227407993671548,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#roots-80s","chapters":["Sección 5.17"],"pages":[[1,193,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":193,"text":"…continuation of the Catheads: The Ode (1992) relished in the juxtaposition of pop and rock, of tradition and new 